; A shared-field envelope. Every key beside `:data` is merged into each element
; of `:data`, one level deep and never recursively. Where an element carries the
; key itself the element wins: the envelope is a default for the group, not an
; override, so a row can opt out without splitting the envelope.
;
; canonical: (:curr "USD" :env :prod :tenant 1042 :data (Order [1 "SSD-1TB" 89.99] [2 "RAM-32GB" 129.5]))

(:curr "USD" :env :prod :tenant 1042
 :data (Order
         [1 "SSD-1TB"  89.99]
         [2 "RAM-32GB" 129.5]))
